---
description: PlanProbe verification invariants
alwaysApply: true
---
- Models propose plans, assumptions, probes, replans, and patches; deterministic executors decide evidence and verdicts.
- Do not turn the product into a chatbot.
- Do not permit arbitrary shell commands from model output.
- Do not patch tests, gate policy, or probe executors to obtain a passing result.
- Preserve evidence links from assumption -> probe -> repository source -> verdict -> revised plan.
